sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FilterBuilder
    participant NostrFilterBuilder
    participant CommonFilters
    participant ValidationService
    participant Parent

    User->>FilterBuilder: Select preset
    FilterBuilder->>CommonFilters: Get preset filter
    CommonFilters-->>FilterBuilder: Return filter config
    FilterBuilder->>NostrFilterBuilder: Build filter
    NostrFilterBuilder-->>FilterBuilder: Return NostrFilter
    FilterBuilder->>ValidationService: Validate filter
    ValidationService-->>FilterBuilder: Validation result
    FilterBuilder-->>User: Update UI with filter

    User->>FilterBuilder: Modify filter field
    FilterBuilder->>NostrFilterBuilder: Update field
    NostrFilterBuilder->>ValidationService: Validate on change
    ValidationService-->>FilterBuilder: Real-time validation
    FilterBuilder-->>User: Show validation feedback

    User->>FilterBuilder: Export filter
    FilterBuilder->>NostrFilterBuilder: Build final filter
    NostrFilterBuilder-->>FilterBuilder: NostrFilter object
    FilterBuilder->>Parent: onFilterChange callback
    Parent-->>FilterBuilder: Acknowledge

    User->>FilterBuilder: Save as template
    FilterBuilder->>FilterBuilder: Store in LocalStorage
    FilterBuilder-->>User: Template saved

    User->>FilterBuilder: Import filter JSON
    FilterBuilder->>ValidationService: Validate imported filter
    alt Valid filter
        ValidationService-->>FilterBuilder: Valid
        FilterBuilder->>NostrFilterBuilder: Load filter
        FilterBuilder-->>User: Filter loaded
    else Invalid filter
        ValidationService-->>FilterBuilder: Invalid
        FilterBuilder-->>User: Show error
    end
